 no argument to sit with  84 billion dollars of cash and cash  equivalents on your balance sheet when  there is five plus percent inflation and  those are the official numbers it is  likely that inflation is actually closer  between 8 to 12  based on a number of estimations and so  if you are going to sit there and lose  intentionally and knowingly billions of  dollars of purchasing power that is  unacceptable to shareholders  shareholders should  absolutely start to ask the question why  does amazon have tens of billions of  dollars on the balance sheet but they  have no protection there is no inflation  hedges sitting on amazon's balance sheet  and so as we go into the holiday season  as we are going to see increases in  demand increases in spending more supply  chain bottlenecks it is likely that we  may actually see inflation get worse  before it gets better if that occurs  amazon will become more and more and  more exposed to the negative side  effects of the high levels of inflation  we know that the government increased  their two percent prediction of  inflation in q4 of 2021 back in the  summer they increased it to 4.8 percent  so the government more than doubled  their expectations of inflation already  this year so it is likely that we are  going to see continued persistent high  levels of inflation we've been over five  percent now for four months in cpi terms  jeff bezos and the rest of the amazon  team must put bitcoin on the balance  sheet but they can't just do it because  they think that it's cool they shouldn't  just do it because they think that  people will talk about it on the  internet this is now an economic  argument this is part of their fiduciary  duty of protecting shareholder value  if you put 84 billion dollars at risk  and watch it melt away with historic  devaluation of the currency you're  failing your shareholders  put bitcoin on amazon's balance sheet  that is the only way you are going to  protect yourself the other inflation  hedge assets will not protect you gold  is down 5  over the last 12 months in nominal terms  if you add in inflation gold is down 10  plus percent on a real return basis you  can't buy illiquid assets like venture  capital or real estate you also can't go  and speculate in the stock market the  only thing that you can do to continue  to protect your shareholder value and  also have the liquidity needed is to  follow microstrategy tesla and square  put bitcoin on the balance sheet and  allow bitcoin to protect your entire  balance sheet with only a two percent  allocation jeff bezos it's time put  bitcoin on the balance sheet
 

